<title>USA: U.S. DAP, ammonia prices unchanged in quiet trade.</title>
<headline>U.S. DAP, ammonia prices unchanged in quiet trade.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices for diammonium phosphate (DAP) and ammonia were unchanged from Monday in quiet trade, dealers said.</p>
<p>&quot;We're going to need to see some agricultural disappearance in the domestic market, which is pretty quiet,&quot; one ammonia dealer said.</p>
<p>			   Dlrs/short ton	 Chg from Monday</p>
<p>DAP central Fla	  174-175			unc</p>
<p>DAP central La Gulf	  187			unc</p>
<p>Ammonia/La Gulf		195			unc</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
